  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGainOnSalesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-indent:4.5pt;"&gt;※３　固定資産売却益の内訳&lt;/p&gt;
